{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/3e3ef4270f1155806cf9c4902b470f77.avif?t=1762190296\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an old fisherman whose love of gambling and wine has led to considerable debt. You'll have to sell your vessel to pay it off. The problem is, the ship no longer matches its original blueprints - a new room has appeared on it, one that shouldn\u2019t exist\u2026<br><br><br><i><strong>EXPLORATION - ON LAND AND AT SEA</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/adab98594d52335ec06e9b9fe8bebdce.poster.avif?t=1762190296\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/adab98594d52335ec06e9b9fe8bebdce.webm?t=1762190296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/adab98594d52335ec06e9b9fe8bebdce.mp4?t=1762190296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-inhabited island now stands deserted - except for you, and a strange old man by a campfire, wearing a wizard\u2019s hat. Explore the surroundings to uncover the secrets of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><i><strong>FISHING!</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/ccce066a770eaf90376c21af5f495ae6.poster.avif?t=1762190296\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/ccce066a770eaf90376c21af5f495ae6.webm?t=1762190296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/ccce066a770eaf90376c21af5f495ae6.mp4?t=1762190296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trawl can pull up just about anything: fat fish, a chest (possibly with treasure), or even an old boot! Some of your catch can be sold to buy items that will aid your journey.<br><br><br><i><strong>AND A TOUCH OF MADNESS\u2026</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/842f9263455068923c6632192b2b89f3.poster.avif?t=1762190296\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/842f9263455068923c6632192b2b89f3.webm?t=1762190296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/842f9263455068923c6632192b2b89f3.mp4?t=1762190296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, you will find yourself engaged in long and curious conversations with\u2026 yourself. Who knows what conclusions self-reflection may lead to? Possibly some very unexpected ones.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/3f5779aec9ec67c83af580aa24adfc63.avif?t=1762190296\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4143130?t=1762190296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4143130?t=1762190296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/75ba756ad81b62ed5cbe5e3f5333fc427961cc42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762190296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/75ba756ad81b62ed5cbe5e3f5333fc427961cc42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762190296","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/3e3ef4270f1155806cf9c4902b470f77.avif?t=1762190296\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an old fisherman whose love of gambling and wine has led to considerable debt. You'll have to sell your vessel to pay it off. The problem is, the ship no longer matches its original blueprints - a new room has appeared on it, one that shouldn\u2019t exist\u2026<br><br><br><i><strong>EXPLORATION - ON LAND AND AT SEA</strong></i><br><i><strong></strong></i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/adab98594d52335ec06e9b9fe8bebdce.poster.avif?t=1762190296\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/adab98594d52335ec06e9b9fe8bebdce.webm?t=1762190296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143130/extras/adab98594d52335ec06e9b9fe8bebdce.mp4?t=1762190296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-inhabited island now stands deserted - except for you, and a strange old man by a campfire, wearing a wizard\u2019s hat. Explore the surroundings to uncover the secrets of this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><i><strong>FISHING!</strong></i><br><